OL,3,GNEWSA'Our photos were stolen and used
OL,4,Ato sell weight loss drugs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and daughter who run a
OL,7,Fclothing shop said they felt "helpless"
OL,8,Fwhen their promotional photos were
OL,9,Fstolen and manipulated to sell weight
OL,10,Floss drugs on social media.
OL,12,FThe images of Nicola Dexter modelling
OL,13,Foutfits were lifted without consent and
OL,14,Faltered to make her appear overweight.
OL,16,FThey were then posted on a TikTok
OL,17,Faccount as "before" and "after" photos
OL,18,Falongside false claims that Nicola had
OL,19,Ftaken a weight loss treatment called
OL,20,FPinkies.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
